            </note>
            <note corresp="#d169-f2" n="1" xml:id="d169-f2-content">
                <p>For text of this statement, which was released to the press at 3:30 p.m., see
                    Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, June 6, 1960, pp.
